{
  "id": "LUK.24",
  "number": "24",
  "bookId": "LUK",
  "reference": "Luka 24",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 53,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "24",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "LUK 24"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "24",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūjūūka kwa ng'wa Yesu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna a ha lūshikū lo kwandya nyuma a bakīma benabo bipuna dilū makīngo, būbūsola nū būgota bo ng'waso nsoga ūbo baalī balonja lonja, būja ū kū shigila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahayūshika koi, būlīsanga ī liwe lyamalaga kūpilingitiwa lyīnjiagwa a ha shigila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho bingīla moi batagūsangile ū mīlī go ng'wa Seeba Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna aho bataalī būgūkumya ū mhayo gwenūyo, bagosha babīlī bīmīīla haho bbihī nabo, bazwalile myenda ya būpe būng'weku no no no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bakīma benabo bogoha no, būyūdetema dūhū biyinamīīlaga; a bagosha benabo būbawīla gīkī, “Nibūlī mulīnkoobela mu bafu ū mpanga? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atīho a henaha wamalaga kūjūūka. Izūkagwi ūmo akamuwīlīla aho walī Galilaya; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gīkī, ‘Ū Ng'wana wa Munhū shing'wigeleelilwe kūtūūlwa mu makono ga banhū ba shibi akong'we ha nsalaba, hanuma ū mu lūshikū lo kadatū lwaho akūjūūka.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bakīma benabo būyizūkwa ī mihayo yakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahayūshoka ū kūfuma ū kū shigila, būbahwegeja pyī ī mihayo yenīyo ab'ikūmi na ūmò, na a bangī pye a bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bakīma abo bakabasomboolela a batūng'wa ī mihayo yenīyo baalī ba Malia Magadalena, na Yoana, nū Malia ū nina wa ng'wa Yakobo, na bichabo bangī abo baalī nabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo aho babawīla batīzunije ī mihayo yabo, nguno īkabiza gītī ya nyachilū chilū dūhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ū Petelo ūbūūka, ūpeela ajile ū kū shigila; aho winama kūlola moi wībona ī myenda ya kūjīkīlwa īlekilwe gīko dūhū. Ūkalīla kūshoka kaya, alīkumya ūshingisha gīkī hīmba gwigelega mhayo kī!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lūgendo lwa kūja Emau",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū lūshikū lwenūlo babīlī babo būbūūka lūgendo kūja kwigūngūli lya Emau, ū kwīnga ī Yelusalemu boolīho bū kūle bo kūshika gītī kilomita ikūmi n'īmò. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu lūgendo lwabo baja bakwisomboojaga pyī īyo yalī yilonga yenīyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho balī mu kwisombooja na kūlūngalūnga gīko, ū Yesu ng'wenekīlī ūbegeela, ūyūshimīza nabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike nūūlū īkī a miso gabo gamonaga, alīyo baalī batang'witegelejaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūbabūja gīkī, “Bing'we mulīshimīza ng'wiwīla mihayo kī ī yenīyī?” Bīmīīla būjinjimala! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūmò wabo, lina lyakwe Kileopa, ūnshokeja ūng'wīla gīkī, “Ū bebe, ī gete ūlī ngeni iyene dūhū shi ū mu Yelusalemu? Ūtamanile ūmo īkūjīlaga ī mihayo yamo ī shikū jenīji?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ūbabūja, “Mihayo kī?” Būnshokeja, “Ī ya ng'wa Yesu, ū muna Nazaleti. Ūyo walī ng'hangi, na munhū wa būdūla mu shītwa na mu kalangīle, kū būtongi bo ng'wa Mulungu; nū kū banhū bose! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bagabīji bataale na a basugi bise bakamfunya ūlamulwa nsango gwa kūbūlagwa, ūkong'wa ha nsalaba! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a bise twalisagīlagwa gīkī hū ng'wene akwīkomoola ī Isiraeli! Nīyo ī lelo lūlī lūshikū lo kadatū kwīngīīla aho yilongelile ī mihayo yenīyī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama hangī ī lelo bakīma balebe ba mu bise batwibakīja; nguno baalī bipuunaga dilū kūja ū kū shigila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo twahayagimanīla bashoka balīhaya batagūbonile ū mīlī gokwe, na gīkī angū baalī bilongelwa na bamalaika būbawīla gīkī alī mpanga! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahene bamò bise baalī baja ko ū kū shigila, būūkasanga gīt'ūmo baalī bahayīla a bakīma; alīyo ū wei batamonile!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yesu ūbawīla, “A bing'we mulī bachilū chilū, nīyo nī myoyo ying'we midīzu no ū kwīzunya pyī īyo īhayiwe na bahangi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yalī ītang'wigeleelilwe ū Kilisito kūluha ū mu mihayo yenīyī, hanuma kwingīla ū ng'wikūjo lyakwe?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū wandya kūbasomboolela pyī īyo yandīkilwe kūlwakwe, kwandīja kūlī Musa, na a bahangi a bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho balyegeela ī ligūngūli īlo bajaga, ū ng'wene wīta gītī alīhaya kūbītīīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo būndayīīla būng'wīla, “Bebe ni olaala henaha; nguno nī likanza lyajaga, wila ū būjikū!” Wingīla ng'hana wikala nabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho lyashika ī likanza lya kūlya wigasha hamò nabo, ūsola ngatī, ūlūmba, hūna ūgūmeganya ūbinha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A henaho a miso gabo gūkundūlīlwa būndeeba; alīyo haho na haho ū wei ūjimīīla balolile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bandya kwiwīla gīkī, “Jalī jitūbīlīlaga īng'holò jise ū mu nzīla, aho walūlūngalūngaga nise, akūtoolekejaga ī mihayo ya mu shandīkwa?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī likanza lyenīlo būbūūka bashokile kūja Yelusalemu, būūkabasanga abo ikūmi na ūmò bibilingaga na a babo baalī hamò nabo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "balīhaya gīkī, “Gashi ng'hana ū Seeba wajūūkaga; wang'wilongelaga nū Simoni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna būbasomboolela ī ya mu nzīla, nū mumo bakandeebela aho wagūmeganya ū ngatī!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kwiyoolecha kwa Ng'wa Yesu Kū Bahemba",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho bataalī būbasomboolela gīko, bahayimanīla wīmīīla ha gatī yabo ūbagīsha, “Mulī mhola!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakibakīla no, hama bogoha; nguno bakiganika babona līng'hangi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbawīla, “Nibūlī mulogoha gīko na kwiganīlīja ū mung'holò jing'we? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nalī nene ng'wenekīlī, galolagi a makono gane nī mhambala jane; munikuumye na kunikuumya mubone, nguno ū moyo gūtī na nofu na maguha, gīt'ūmo mulīnibonela ū nene gīkī nalī nasho ī shenīsho.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wamala ū kūhaya ī yenīyo, ūboolekeja a makono gakwe nī mhambala jakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna aho bataalī ū kūzunya chiza, alīyo bokalaga būyegi na kūkumya kūtaale; ūbabūja, “Mulī na shilīwa shose shose a henaha?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būng'winha ibudīka lya ndīlo ya booche. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūyanukūla wīlya balolile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūbawīla gīkī, “Ī yenīyī h'ī mihayo yane īyo nikalaga nūmuwīla aho naalī nataalī hamò ning'we, gīkī shiigelile īshikīlījiwe pyī īyo yandīkilwe kūlwa nguno yane, mu shitabo sha ng'wa Musa na mu bahangi, na mu Zabuli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūgakundūlīla a masala gabo, būshiitegeleja ī shandīkwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbawīla, “H'ūmo yandīkīlilwe; gīkī ū Kilisito shiigelile aluhiwe, alīyo a ha lūshikū lo kadatū lwaho ajūūke kūfuma mu bafu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna a banhū ba mahanga gose, kwandīja Yelusalemu, bakūlomeelwa mu lina lyakwe, mihayo ya kūgalūka na kūlekejiwa kwa shibi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bing'we hū mulī bakaanīji bayo ī mihayo yenīyī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo nakūmutūmīla īsho wang'wisagīja ū Baba; gwike ikalagi dūhū ū mu nzengo, kūshisha mugumīīlwe būdūla bo kūfuma kwigūlya.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.49"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūja ng'wigūlū kwa ng'wa Yesu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ūfuma nabo hanze abatongeelile; bahayūshika Betania ūbūūcha a makono gakwe kūbinha lubango. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho alībinha lubango gīko, kwimanīla walekana nabo, ūbūūchiwa ng'wilunde. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahayūmala kūnamya būshoka Yelusalemu bokalaga būyegi hataale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakayudīla mu hekalu gwa gwa gwa bakūnkumīlījaga Mulungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.53"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
